        "Title": "THE HIPPOCRATIC BETRAYAL",
        "Location": "LOCATION_HOKKAIDO",
        "PublicId": "110217131447",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_snowcrane.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 805255ab-4f42-4dec-a35f-c60475f1c322).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47. GAMA, Japan&apos;s finest hospital, hides a sinister secret. Five employees operate The White Veil, an assassination network disguising murders as medical accidents. A doctor, bodyguard, chef, cleaner, and attendant have claimed dozens of lives. Unfortunately, they&apos;ve now acquired classified ICA intelligence, including your identity. Our client wants all five eliminated before that information spreads. It seems they&apos;ve forgotten their oath to do no harm. Good hunting, 47.",
